    "e> v, usize i) : ref<T, exclusive>\n    requires\n    {\n        i < v.len, index_out_of_bounds;\n    }\n"
    "{\n    // D-0222: element i of `*v` is accessed exclusively through `v`, as `[Index-Vec]` checks `(*v"
