    "b);\n        width = if (width > n)\n        {\n            n\n        }\n        else\n        {\n        "
    "    width * 2\n        };\n    }\n    a\n}fn Vec::sorted_order_keys<T>(ref<Vec<T>, shared> v) : Vec<usiz"
    "e>\n{\n    usize n = v.len;\n    Vec<usize> a = Vec::new();\n    Vec<usize> b = Vec::new();\n    usize i "
