    ",\n            None    :\n            {\n            },\n        }\n    }\n    taken\n}fn Vec::take_raw<T>("
    "ref<Vec<T>, exclusive> v, usize i) : T\n{\n    unsafe\n    {\n        rawptr<T> p = v.ptr + reinterpret<"
