    "<Vec<u8>>\n{\n    crypto_check_lengths(key, nonce);\n    usize n = slice_len(sealed);\n    if (n < 16)\n "
    "   {\n        return None;\n    }\n    array<u8, 16> want = aead_tag(key, nonce, aad, &sealed[0..n - 16"
