    "e<u64>(s, 19) >> 1) & FE_MASK,\n        (read_le<u64>(s, 24) >> 12) & FE_MASK,\n    ]\n}fn fe_to_bytes("
    "array<u64, 5> f) : array<u8, 32>\n{\n    array<u64, 5> h = fe_carry(fe_carry(f));\n    // q is 1 exactl"
