    "ult::ok: dropping the error\":\n        Result<i32, u8> bad = Err(4);\n        assert(Result::unwrap_or"
    "(bad, 0) == 0);\n        Result<i32, u8> good = Ok(9);\n        Option<i32> o = Result::ok(good);\n    "
    "    assert(Option::is_some(&o) && Option::unwrap(o) == 9);\n\u{1f}\u{1e}std::core\u{1f}Result::unwrap_or\u{1f}fn\u{1f}export f"
    "n Result::unwrap_or<T, E>(Result<T, E> r, T d) : T\u{1f}The value in `r`, or `d` when `r` is `Err`.\u{1f}\u{1f}expo"
    "rt fn Result::unwrap_or<T, E>(Result<T, E> r, T d) : T\n    in `std::core`\n\n    The value in `r`, or "
