    "n::unwrap\u{1f}fn\u{1f}export fn Option::unwrap<T>(Option<T> o) : T\u{1f}The value in `o`.\u{1f}\u{1f}export fn Option::unwra"
    "p<T>(Option<T> o) : T\n    in `std::core`\n\n    The value in `o`.\n\n    Faults (`unwrap_failed`) when `"
