    " 25;\n        assert(Result::unwrap_or(Vec::binary_search(&v, present), 99) == 1);\n        match (Vec"
    "::binary_search(&v, absent))\n        {\n            Ok(_)  : assert(false),\n            Err(i) : asse"
    "rt(i == 3),\n        }\n\u{1f}\u{1e}std::collections\u{1f}Vec::clear\u{1f}fn\u{1f}export fn Vec::clear<T>(ref<Vec<T>, exclusive"
    "> v)\u{1f}Removes every element of `v`, destroying them first to last; the buffer is kept for reuse.\u{1f}\u{1f}exp"
    "ort fn Vec::clear<T>(ref<Vec<T>, exclusive> v)\n    in `std::collections`\n\n    Removes every element "
