    "fn\u{1f}export fn Vec::insert<T>(ref<Vec<T>, exclusive> v, usize i, T x)\u{1f}Inserts `x` at index `i`, moving"
    " the elements from `i` on up by one.\u{1f}\u{1f}export fn Vec::insert<T>(ref<Vec<T>, exclusive> v, usize i, T "
    "x)\n    in `std::collections`\n    requires\n        i <= v.len, index_out_of_bounds\n\n    Inserts `x` a"
    "t index `i`, moving the elements from `i` on up by one.\n\n    `i` may equal `len`, which appends. Fau"
