    "insert(&mut v, 3, 4);\n        assert(Vec::len(&v) == 4);\n        assert(v[0] == 1 && v[1] == 2 && v["
    "2] == 3 && v[3] == 4);\n\u{1f}\u{1e}std::collections\u{1f}Vec::remove\u{1f}fn\u{1f}export fn Vec::remove<T>(ref<Vec<T>, exclus"
    "ive> v, usize i) : T\u{1f}Removes the element at index `i` and returns it, moving the elements after it d"
    "own by one.\u{1f}\u{1f}export fn Vec::remove<T>(ref<Vec<T>, exclusive> v, usize i) : T\n    in `std::collection"
    "s`\n    requires\n        i < v.len, index_out_of_bounds\n\n    Removes the element at index `i` and ret"
