    "urn `NULL`.\n    `String::from_c` also checks that the bytes are UTF-8.\n\u{1f}\u{1e}std::collections\u{1f}Vec::from_"
    "fn\u{1f}fn\u{1f}export fn Vec::from_fn<T>(usize n, fn(usize) : T f) : Vec<T>\u{1f}A new `Vec` of `f(0), f(1), …, "
    "f(n - 1)`, called in that order.\u{1f}\u{1f}export fn Vec::from_fn<T>(usize n, fn(usize) : T f) : Vec<T>\n    i"
    "n `std::collections`\n\n    A new `Vec` of `f(0), f(1), …, f(n - 1)`, called in that order.\n\n    Wor"
    "ks for any `T`, including resources.\n\n    Example, \"Vec::from_fn: with retain\":\n        Vec<i32> v ="
