    "lusive> v, usize i, usize j)\u{1f}Exchanges elements `i` and `j` of `v`; nothing happens when `i == j`.\u{1f}\u{1f}"
    "export fn Vec::swap<T>(ref<Vec<T>, exclusive> v, usize i, usize j)\n    in `std::collections`\n    req"
    "uires\n        i < v.len && j < v.len, index_out_of_bounds\n\n    Exchanges elements `i` and `j` of `v`"
    "; nothing happens when `i == j`.\n\n    Use it rather than `swap(&mut v[i], &mut v[j])`, which is two "
