    "as a shared reference; `None` when `q` is empty.\u{1f}\u{1f}export fn Queue::front<T>(ref<Queue<T>, shared> q)"
    " : Option<ref<T, shared>>\n    in `std::collections`\n\n    The front element of `q`, as a shared refer"
