    " the queue, which cannot change while it is in use.\n\n    Example, \"Queue: both ends\":\n        Queue<"
    "i32> q = Queue::new();\n        Queue::push_back(&mut q, 2);\n        Queue::push_back(&mut q, 3);\n   "
