    "e `sizeof<T>()` bytes start at `s[at]`, least significant byte first (little-endian).\n\n    The type "
    "is written at the call: `read_le<u32>(&buf[0..$], 4)`. A signed `T` is read as two's\n    complement."
    " Faults (`index_out_of_bounds`) when fewer than `sizeof<T>()` bytes remain from `at`.\n\n    Example, "
