    "lready.\n\u{1f}\u{1e}std::fs\u{1f}remove_dir_all\u{1f}fn\u{1f}export fn remove_dir_all(StringView path) : Result<void, FileErr"
    "or>\u{1f}Removes the directory `path` and everything in it.\u{1f}\u{1f}export fn remove_dir_all(StringView path) : "
    "Result<void, FileError>\n    in `std::fs`\n\n    Removes the directory `path` and everything in it.\n\n  "
    "  `Err(NotFound)` when nothing is at `path`.\n\u{1f}\u{1e}std::env\u{1f}arg_bytes\u{1f}extern fn\u{1f}export unsafe extern fn "
