    "es whatever they are; `arg` is the safe way to read one.\n\u{1f}\u{1e}std::env\u{1f}arg_count\u{1f}fn\u{1f}export fn arg_count"
    "() : usize\u{1f}The number of the program's arguments, not counting the program's own name.\u{1f}\u{1f}export fn ar"
