    "e back of `ch`, waiting while the channel is full.\u{1f}\u{1f}export fn Channel::send<T>(ref<Channel<T>, share"
    "d> ch, T v) : Result<void, T>\n    in `std::sync`\n\n    Puts `v` at the back of `ch`, waiting while th"
    "e channel is full.\n\n    `Err(v)`, the value handed back, once the channel is closed. Exclusive refer"
    "ences inside `v` are lent to\n    the receiving thread: the sender's own copies of them clash with th"
    "em while they live.\n\u{1f}\u{1e}std::sync\u{1f}Channel::recv\u{1f}fn\u{1f}export fn Channel::recv<T>(ref<Channel<T>, shared> "
