    "n pow<T: number>(T base, u32 exp) : T\n    in `std::math`\n\n    `base` raised to the power `exp`, by r"
    "epeated squaring; `pow(x, 0)` is 1.\n\n    Checked: faults (`arith_overflow`) only when the result doe"
