    "  BigUint::bit_len(a) <= width * 8, arith_overflow\n\n    The big-endian bytes of `a` in exactly `widt"
    "h` bytes, zeros in front.\n\n    Faults (`arith_overflow`) when `a` needs more than `width` bytes.\n\n  "
    "  Example, \"BigUint::to_bytes_be_padded: minimal and padded bytes\":\n        BigUint x = BigUint::fro"
