    "t).\n\n    `Ok(None)` when the peer has closed its side; `Err(NotUtf8(e))` for a line that is not UTF-"
    "8. Reads as\n    `File::read_line` does.\n\u{1f}\u{1e}std::net\u{1f}TcpStream::write\u{1f}fn\u{1f}export fn TcpStream::write(re"
