    "e> s) : Result<void, NetError>\u{1f}Closes the sending side of the connection; this side can still read.\u{1f}"
    "\u{1f}export fn TcpStream::shutdown_write(ref<TcpStream, exclusive> s) : Result<void, NetError>\n    in `s"
    "td::net`\n\n    Closes the sending side of the connection; this side can still read.\n\n    The peer rea"
