    "ort fn UdpSocket::bind(SocketAddr a) : Result<UdpSocket, NetError>\u{1f}Opens a UDP socket bound to `a`; "
    "port 0 asks the system for a free port.\u{1f}\u{1f}export fn UdpSocket::bind(SocketAddr a) : Result<UdpSocket,"
