    "g `recv_from` and `recv` wait for a datagram, in milliseconds; 0 waits for ever.\u{1f}\u{1f}export fn UdpSocke"
    "t::set_read_timeout_ms(ref<UdpSocket, exclusive> u, u64 ms)\n    in `std::net`\n\n    Sets how long `re"
    "cv_from` and `recv` wait for a datagram, in milliseconds; 0 waits for ever.\n\n    After the timeout t"
