    " NetError>\u{1f}Sends `data` as one datagram to `to`, and gives the number of bytes sent.\u{1f}\u{1f}export fn UdpS"
    "ocket::send_to(ref<UdpSocket, exclusive> u, slice<u8, shared> data, SocketAddr to) : Result<usize, N"
