    "ad timeout.\n\u{1f}\u{1e}std::net\u{1f}UdpSocket::drop\u{1f}fn\u{1f}export fn UdpSocket::drop(ref<UdpSocket, exclusive> self)\u{1f}"
    "Closes the socket; run when a `UdpSocket` is dropped.\u{1f}\u{1f}export fn UdpSocket::drop(ref<UdpSocket, excl"
