    "ad while another writes.\u{1f}\u{1f}export fn TcpStream::try_clone(ref<TcpStream, shared> s) : Result<TcpStrea"
    "m, NetError>\n    in `std::net`\n\n    A second `TcpStream` on the same connection, for reading in one "
    "thread while another writes.\n\n    Each thread takes its own stream by `move`. Bytes read through one"
    " are not seen by the other, and each\n    has its own timeouts; `shutdown_write` through either ends "
    "sending for both, and the connection closes\n    when the last of them is dropped.\n\u{1f}\u{1e}std::net\u{1f}UdpSock"
