    " public exponent.\n\u{1f}\u{1e}std::crypto::pk\u{1f}rsa_sign_pkcs1v15\u{1f}fn\u{1f}export fn rsa_sign_pkcs1v15(ref<RsaPrivateK"
    "ey, shared> key, HashKind kind, slice<u8, shared> digest) : Vec<u8>\u{1f}`key`'s RSASSA-PKCS1-v1_5 signat"
    "ure (RFC 8017 §8.2.1) of a message whose `kind` digest is `digest`.\u{1f}\u{1f}export fn rsa_sign_pkcs1v15(re"
    "f<RsaPrivateKey, shared> key, HashKind kind, slice<u8, shared> digest) : Vec<u8>\n    in `std::crypto"
    "::pk`\n\n    `key`'s RSASSA-PKCS1-v1_5 signature (RFC 8017 §8.2.1) of a message whose `kind` digest i"
