    "'s digests, or the modulus is\n    shorter than the encoding plus 11 bytes.\n\u{1f}\u{1e}std::crypto::pk\u{1f}rsa_sig"
    "n_pss\u{1f}fn\u{1f}export fn rsa_sign_pss(ref<RsaPrivateKey, shared> key, HashKind kind, slice<u8, shared> dig"
