    "digest`.\u{1f}\u{1f}export fn rsa_sign_pss(ref<RsaPrivateKey, shared> key, HashKind kind, slice<u8, shared> di"
    "gest) : Vec<u8>\n    in `std::crypto::pk`\n\n    `key`'s RSASSA-PSS signature (RFC 8017 §8.1.1) of a m"
    "essage whose `kind` digest is `digest`.\n\n    With MGF1 over the same hash and a salt of `os_random_b"
    "ytes` as long as the digest: a different signature\n    every time, each accepted by `rsa_verify_pss`"
