    "LS server.\n    - `ChainTooLong`: no root was reached within 10 certificates.\n\u{1f}\u{1e}std::x509\u{1f}CertError::"
    "text\u{1f}fn\u{1f}export fn CertError::text(ref<CertError, shared> e) : str\u{1f}A short English description of `e`"
    ", such as \"certificate expired\", for a message.\u{1f}\u{1f}export fn CertError::text(ref<CertError, shared> e)"
    " : str\n    in `std::x509`\n\n    A short English description of `e`, such as \"certificate expired\", fo"
    "r a message.\n\u{1f}\u{1e}std::x509\u{1f}Der\u{1f}struct\u{1f}export struct Der\u{1f}One DER element (ITU-T X.690), as `der_read` r"
    "eads it: its tag and where its contents lie.\u{1f}\u{1f}export struct Der\n    in `std::x509`\n\n    One DER elem"
    "ent (ITU-T X.690), as `der_read` reads it: its tag and where its contents lie.\n\n    - `tag`: the tag"
