    "cPublicKey\n    in `std::x509`\n\n    An elliptic-curve public key: the curve and the uncompressed poin"
    "t (0x04 ‖ x ‖ y).\n\u{1f}\u{1e}std::x509\u{1f}CertKey\u{1f}enum\u{1f}export enum CertKey\u{1f}A public key, as a certificate or"
