    "er algorithm; a certificate with one parses, but no signature verifies\n      under it.\n\u{1f}\u{1e}std::x509\u{1f}S"
    "ignatureScheme\u{1f}enum\u{1f}export enum SignatureScheme\u{1f}A signature algorithm with its hash, as certificates"
    " and TLS name them.\u{1f}\u{1f}export enum SignatureScheme\n    in `std::x509`\n\n    A signature algorithm with "
