    "LS 1.3 connection over a `TcpStream`, as a client (`client`, `connect`) or as a server (`server`).\n\n"
    "    It speaks the cipher suites TLS_CHACHA20_POLY1305_SHA256, TLS_AES_128_GCM_SHA256 and\n    TLS_AES"
