    "pty `chain`. The timeouts\n    set on `tcp` apply to every read and write.\n\u{1f}\u{1e}std::http\u{1f}HttpError\u{1f}enum"
    "\u{1f}export enum HttpError\u{1f}Why an HTTP request or connection failed.\u{1f}\u{1f}export enum HttpError\n    in `std:"
    ":http`\n\n    Why an HTTP request or connection failed.\n\n    - `HttpNetFailure(e)`: the network failed"
    ", as `e` says.\n    - `HttpTlsFailure(e)`: the TLS connection failed, as `e` says.\n    - `BadUrl`: th"
    "e URL is malformed (`Url::parse`).\n    - `UnsupportedScheme`: the URL's scheme is neither `http` nor"
    " `https`.\n    - `NoRoots`: an https request needed the system's trusted roots and `TrustStore::syste"
    "m` failed.\n    - `BadMessage`: an HTTP message received is malformed.\n    - `TooLarge`: a message's "
