    "o `\\u` escapes is joined, and a lone surrogate becomes U+FFFD.\n\n    Example, \"Json::parse: where the"
    " error is\":\n        match (Json::parse(\"[1, 2\"))\n        {\n            Err(Invalid(i)) : assert(i =="
