    "     {\n            Err(Invalid(i)) : assert(i == 4),\n            _               : assert(false),\n  "
    "      }\n\u{1f}\u{1e}std::encoding::json\u{1f}Json::text\u{1f}fn\u{1f}export fn Json::text(ref<Json, shared> j) : String\u{1f}The v"
    "alue `j` as compact JSON text: no white space, members and elements in order.\u{1f}\u{1f}export fn Json::text("
    "ref<Json, shared> j) : String\n    in `std::encoding::json`\n\n    The value `j` as compact JSON text: "
    "no white space, members and elements in order.\n\n    A whole number within 2^53 is written without a "
    "fraction, any other in the shortest digits that read back\n    as it, and a NaN or an infinity, which"
