    " wrong checksum\":\n        Vec<u8> z = zlib_deflate(b\"hello hello hello\");\n        usize last = Vec::"
    "len(&z) - 1;\n        z[last] = z[last] ^ 1;\n        match (zlib_inflate(&z, 100))\n        {\n        "
    "    Err(Corrupt(at)) : assert(at == last - 3),\n            _                : assert(false),\n       "
    " }\n\u{1f}\u{1e}std::compress\u{1f}gzip\u{1f}fn\u{1f}export fn gzip(slice<u8, shared> data) : Vec<u8>\u{1f}`data` compressed as a g"
