    "red> data) : Vec<u8>\n    in `std::compress`\n\n    `data` compressed as a gzip file (RFC 1952), with n"
    "o name, time or extra fields in its header.\n\n    The trailer holds the CRC-32 and the length of `dat"
    "a` modulo 2 to the power 32.\n\u{1f}\u{1e}std::compress\u{1f}gunzip\u{1f}fn\u{1f}export fn gunzip(slice<u8, shared> data, usiz"
    "e max) : Result<Vec<u8>, CompressError>\u{1f}The bytes a gzip file encodes, every member in turn, at most"
