    "port fn CString::from_bytes(slice<u8, shared> b) : Result<CString, NulError>\u{1f}`b` with a NUL byte aft"
    "er it, or `Err` with the position of the first NUL already in `b`.\u{1f}\u{1f}export fn CString::from_bytes(sl"
